WEBVTT

00:00:03.121 --> 00:00:06.001
You are one of the Seafolk, correct?

00:00:06.001 --> 00:00:07.541
Who's asking?

00:00:09.131 --> 00:00:12.051
You must be another soldier—

00:00:12.051 --> 00:00:13.841
I am here to eliminate you.

00:00:32.651 --> 00:00:34.491
Was that…

00:00:34.491 --> 00:00:35.911
the last of them?

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:39.781
Wow!

00:00:39.781 --> 00:00:40.541
Awesome!

00:00:40.541 --> 00:00:41.541
Amazing!

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:43.961
They must have been terrified.

00:00:50.501 --> 00:00:51.671
Now I'm angry.

00:00:52.511 --> 00:00:55.051
I'm gonna tear you to shreds.

00:00:55.431 --> 00:00:57.341
I let my guard down again.

00:00:57.341 --> 00:00:59.681
I never learn.

00:01:01.761 --> 00:01:03.181
Saitama…

00:01:03.181 --> 00:01:05.151
Saitama

00:01:03.181 --> 00:01:05.151
Class C / Rank 2

00:01:03.181 --> 00:01:05.151
City Z

00:01:03.811 --> 00:01:05.141
You're Class C, rank 2.

00:01:05.601 --> 00:01:07.191
Are you sure?

00:01:07.191 --> 00:01:07.901
Yeah.

00:01:08.561 --> 00:01:10.651
Hurry it up. It's raining.

00:01:10.651 --> 00:01:17.161
Saitama

00:01:10.651 --> 00:01:17.161
Class C / Rank 2

00:01:11.651 --> 00:01:14.691
He shattered every single record in the fitness test…

00:01:14.691 --> 00:01:17.821
And he worked with some S-class heroes
to destroy that meteor.

00:01:18.661 --> 00:01:23.701
But because he came out of nowhere,
people are saying he's a fraud.

00:01:23.701 --> 00:01:26.331
I'd stop him if he were any other C-class hero…

00:01:29.421 --> 00:01:33.171
This may be our chance to see how strong he truly is.

00:01:35.761 --> 00:01:39.681
Saitama, I'm sending you the location.
Head there immediately.

00:01:48.521 --> 00:01:53.021
UNYIELDING JUSTICE

00:02:02.371 --> 00:02:06.121
ONE PUNCH

00:02:09.831 --> 00:02:11.581
THREE, TWO, ONE, KILL SHOT

00:02:11.581 --> 00:02:15.341
JOIN THE FIGHT, CERTAIN VICTORY, THE STRONGEST EVER

00:02:11.581 --> 00:02:15.341
SANJOU, HISSHOU, SHIJOU SAIKYOU

00:02:15.341 --> 00:02:17.341
WHAT WAS THAT? FRUSTRATION

00:02:15.341 --> 00:02:17.341
NAN DATTEN DA? FRUSTRATION

00:02:17.341 --> 00:02:18.841
THERE'S NO STOPPING ME

00:02:17.341 --> 00:02:18.841
ORE WA TOMARANAI

00:02:18.841 --> 00:02:22.971
ONE PUNCH, IT'S OVER, VICTORY AFTER VICTORY

00:02:18.841 --> 00:02:22.971
ONE PUNCH, KANRYOU, RENSENRENSHOU

00:02:22.971 --> 00:02:26.601
I WIN, I ALWAYS WIN, OVERWHELMINGLY

00:02:22.971 --> 00:02:26.601
ORE WA KATSU, TSUNE NI KATSU, ASSHOU

00:02:26.601 --> 00:02:30.441
POWER, GET POWER

00:02:30.441 --> 00:02:33.401
RIGHT TO THE VERY LIMIT

00:02:30.441 --> 00:02:33.401
GIRIGIRI GENKAI MADE

00:02:33.401 --> 00:02:34.611
HERO

00:02:34.611 --> 00:02:37.781
PEOPLE SHOWER ME WITH PRAISE

00:02:34.611 --> 00:02:37.781
ORE O TATAERU KOE YA

00:02:37.781 --> 00:02:40.821
BUT I DON'T DO THIS FOR THE FAME

00:02:37.781 --> 00:02:40.821
KASSAI NANTE HOSHIKU WA NAI SA

00:02:40.821 --> 00:02:42.071
HERO

00:02:42.071 --> 00:02:46.831
SO I JUST FIGHT EVIL IN SECRET

00:02:42.071 --> 00:02:46.831
DAKARA HITOSHIREZU AKU TO TATAKAU

00:02:46.831 --> 00:02:48.291
(NOBODY KNOWS WHO HE IS)

00:02:48.291 --> 00:02:52.461
COUNTLESS ENEMIES FILL THE SKY

00:02:48.291 --> 00:02:52.461
SORA OOI OSHIYOSERU TEKI

00:02:52.461 --> 00:02:55.541
BUT I WON'T TURN MY BACK AND FLEE

00:02:52.461 --> 00:02:55.541
ORE WA SE WO MUKE WA SHINAI

00:02:55.541 --> 00:02:56.881
HERO

00:02:56.881 --> 00:03:01.881
I'VE MADE UP MY MIND AND I WON'T GIVE IN

00:02:56.881 --> 00:03:01.881
NARABA YURUGINAKI KAKUGO SHITA TAME

00:03:01.881 --> 00:03:09.101
A FIGHTING HERO

00:03:01.881 --> 00:03:09.101
TATAKAU HERO

00:03:09.101 --> 00:03:15.651
A SOLITARY HERO

00:03:09.101 --> 00:03:15.651
KODOKU NA HERO

00:03:15.651 --> 00:03:20.651
I WANNA BE THE STRONGEST HERO

00:03:15.651 --> 00:03:20.651
I WANNA BE A SAIKYOU HERO

00:03:25.121 --> 00:03:28.751
Those who can walk, leave the shelter now!

00:03:29.161 --> 00:03:30.661
I cannot promise I will win.

00:03:31.541 --> 00:03:34.001
Run, while I keep him busy!

00:03:38.801 --> 00:03:43.971
None of you monkeys will escape me!

00:04:09.831 --> 00:04:11.251
Lightning Eye!

00:04:14.371 --> 00:04:15.121
I can't see!

00:04:19.421 --> 00:04:22.091
Machine Gun Blows!

00:04:26.091 --> 00:04:28.851
You do like combo attacks, don't you?

00:04:38.361 --> 00:04:40.821
Y-You can do it!

00:04:40.821 --> 00:04:42.031
Quiet!

00:04:45.491 --> 00:04:47.821
Now you melt, girl.

00:05:19.021 --> 00:05:21.021
If you had just focused on me,

00:05:23.031 --> 00:05:27.411
you could've easily dodged my little ball of acid.

00:05:27.411 --> 00:05:30.531
Instead, you chose to sacrifice yourself to save some brat.

00:05:30.531 --> 00:05:35.411
You're a fool, but I give you credit for giving me a few scratches.

00:05:36.371 --> 00:05:38.421
They've already healed, of course.

00:05:39.001 --> 00:05:40.421
Now, die.

00:05:41.501 --> 00:05:43.591
Justice Crash!

00:05:51.301 --> 00:05:54.971
The righteous cyclist, Mumen Rider, is here!

00:05:56.981 --> 00:05:58.901
The top-ranked hero in Class C?

00:05:59.851 --> 00:06:00.941
D-Don't…

00:06:01.441 --> 00:06:02.941
It's Mumen Rider!

00:06:03.441 --> 00:06:05.611
Mumen Rider came for us.

00:06:06.571 --> 00:06:07.701
But he…

00:06:09.861 --> 00:06:11.411
I'm bored already.

00:06:27.011 --> 00:06:29.431
Oh, my apologies.

00:06:29.721 --> 00:06:32.181
I nearly forgot to kill you.

00:06:33.721 --> 00:06:35.851
Justice Tackle!

00:06:45.071 --> 00:06:46.611
Nobody expects much…

00:06:51.911 --> 00:06:53.241
…from me.

00:06:54.121 --> 00:06:58.411
They think a C-class hero won't be much help.

00:07:03.461 --> 00:07:06.461
I know that better than anyone!

00:07:06.461 --> 00:07:08.631
I'm not good enough for Class B.

00:07:09.671 --> 00:07:13.431
I'm weak. I know that much.

00:07:14.851 --> 00:07:19.391
No one has to tell me I don't stand a chance against you.

00:07:19.391 --> 00:07:21.311
I already know that!

00:07:22.981 --> 00:07:26.071
What are you babbling about?

00:07:26.071 --> 00:07:27.691
Begging for your life?

00:07:28.401 --> 00:07:30.741
And yet, I have to try.

00:07:32.701 --> 00:07:35.201
It's not about winning or losing!

00:07:35.201 --> 00:07:40.201
It's about me taking you on
right here, right now!

00:07:44.381 --> 00:07:48.801
Enough of your rambling.
Time to finish you off.

00:07:50.921 --> 00:07:51.881
You can do it!

00:07:53.431 --> 00:07:57.011
Mumen Rider, you can do it!

00:07:58.391 --> 00:08:01.891
You're the cyclist of justice!

00:08:03.351 --> 00:08:06.651
Beat that weird monster!
Beat him up!

00:08:07.271 --> 00:08:09.781
You can do it!

00:08:10.321 --> 00:08:11.941
Yeah, get him!

00:08:11.941 --> 00:08:13.571
Beat him up!

00:08:13.571 --> 00:08:16.281
We're counting on you, Mumen Rider!

00:08:16.281 --> 00:08:17.201
We believe in you!

00:08:17.201 --> 00:08:18.331
Beat him!

00:08:18.331 --> 00:08:19.911
You can do it!

00:08:38.641 --> 00:08:41.021
I think not!

00:08:46.061 --> 00:08:48.401
You did well. Nice fight.

00:08:50.481 --> 00:08:54.281
Well, well. Has yet another piece of garbage washed up on my shore?

00:08:56.781 --> 00:08:58.371
H-Hey, Genos!

00:08:58.371 --> 00:09:00.741
Are you still alive?!

00:09:01.411 --> 00:09:03.581
Master…

00:09:05.831 --> 00:09:08.041
Hang on for a second.

00:09:08.041 --> 00:09:10.501
I gotta pound this Seafreak
or whatever it's called.

00:09:12.091 --> 00:09:13.591
I heard that!

00:09:19.391 --> 00:09:20.721
Impressive.

00:09:20.721 --> 00:09:23.521
You're still on your feet
after one of my punches.

00:09:24.231 --> 00:09:27.231
Clearly you're different
from the rest of this trash.

00:09:27.231 --> 00:09:30.521
Huh? Your punch was too weak, that's all.

00:09:31.021 --> 00:09:33.111
Hey, someone else is over there.

00:09:33.111 --> 00:09:35.491
Who is that? A hero?

00:09:35.491 --> 00:09:36.321
That head…

00:09:36.741 --> 00:09:38.531
I remember it from the Hero Registry.

00:09:38.531 --> 00:09:41.331
I know him! He's a C-class rookie.

00:09:41.331 --> 00:09:42.871
I think he's rank 2.

00:09:42.871 --> 00:09:44.451
C-class?

00:09:44.451 --> 00:09:48.001
So we're all still gonna die…

00:09:48.001 --> 00:09:51.001
But that punch didn't hurt him at all.

00:09:51.001 --> 00:09:52.041
That's your imagination.

00:09:52.551 --> 00:09:56.801
You saw how many heroes were
blown away by that thing's punches, right?

00:09:58.721 --> 00:10:03.261
I am the Deep Sea King, Lord of the Seas.

00:10:03.261 --> 00:10:07.561
The sea is mother to all life on Earth.

00:10:07.561 --> 00:10:10.231
In other words, as ruler of the seas,

00:10:10.231 --> 00:10:16.071
I am the pinnacle of all living organisms on the planet!

00:10:16.071 --> 00:10:17.701
To defy me is to—

00:10:17.701 --> 00:10:20.031
Yeah, yeah, I got it.

00:10:20.031 --> 00:10:21.951
It's raining, so let's get this over with.

00:10:44.761 --> 00:10:47.311
What?!

00:10:47.311 --> 00:10:48.021
Awesome!

00:10:48.021 --> 00:10:49.351
That was amazing!

00:10:51.901 --> 00:10:52.651
Thank goodness!

00:10:52.651 --> 00:10:53.981
He did it!

00:11:02.821 --> 00:11:04.071
Well, that was lame.

00:11:04.621 --> 00:11:07.081
I kinda had my hopes up, too.

00:11:14.211 --> 00:11:17.131
I'm back with my weapons.

00:11:17.131 --> 00:11:19.971
But damn you, Deep Sea King.

00:11:19.971 --> 00:11:21.261
You got away.

00:11:35.111 --> 00:11:37.781
Hey, what's that?

00:11:38.571 --> 00:11:39.781
It is the mail.

00:11:41.201 --> 00:11:45.991
The post office can no longer deliver here,
so mail is now sent by drone.

00:11:45.991 --> 00:11:47.451
A post office drone?

00:11:47.451 --> 00:11:50.961
No, it belongs to the Hero Association.

00:11:50.961 --> 00:11:52.121
I see.

00:11:54.251 --> 00:11:59.171
The public sends these to the heroes,
much like fan letters.

00:11:59.171 --> 00:12:02.381
Seriously? Are there any for me?

00:12:02.381 --> 00:12:07.301
To S - class Hero

00:12:02.381 --> 00:12:07.301
Mr. Genos

00:12:02.631 --> 00:12:07.301
To C-class Hero
Saitama

00:12:03.471 --> 00:12:04.301
There are.

00:12:04.301 --> 00:12:07.301
Oh! Let's go in and open them!

00:12:09.561 --> 00:12:12.811
Dear Mr. Genos,

00:12:09.561 --> 00:12:12.811
I'm a huge fan of yours!

00:12:09.561 --> 00:12:12.811
I've been cheering for you ever since I

00:12:09.561 --> 00:12:12.811
first laid eyes on you!

00:12:09.561 --> 00:12:12.811
I think that you are a true hero.

00:12:09.561 --> 00:12:12.811
I even joined your fan club!

00:12:09.561 --> 00:12:12.811
I'm just crazy about you!

00:12:15.311 --> 00:12:18.941
To C-class Hero
Saitama

00:12:21.491 --> 00:12:24.991
SHAME ON YOU

00:12:21.491 --> 00:12:24.991
YOU FUCKING FRAUD

00:12:21.491 --> 00:12:24.991
YOU'RE NO HERO

00:12:24.991 --> 00:12:28.491
To C-Class Hero
Saitama

00:12:25.321 --> 00:12:26.661
How dare they…

00:12:26.661 --> 00:12:28.491
I'll find out who sent it.

00:12:28.991 --> 00:12:30.741
This guy sure has some free time.

00:12:37.921 --> 00:12:39.841
All it took was one punch!

00:12:39.841 --> 00:12:42.091
One punch! Just one!

00:12:42.091 --> 00:12:43.921
Is he really C-class?

00:12:43.921 --> 00:12:45.261
He's too strong!

00:12:45.261 --> 00:12:47.221
Or maybe…

00:12:47.221 --> 00:12:51.271
the monster wasn't really that tough?

00:12:51.271 --> 00:12:54.351
But so many heroes went down fighting him.

00:12:54.351 --> 00:12:57.731
That just means those heroes were weaklings.

00:12:58.111 --> 00:13:03.191
Maybe… I suppose the monster didn't look all that tough when he killed it.

00:13:03.191 --> 00:13:07.741
After all, a C-class hero
took it out with a single punch!

00:13:07.741 --> 00:13:09.491
What's that say about the heroes it beat?

00:13:10.371 --> 00:13:13.331
They may call themselves A-class or S-class,

00:13:13.331 --> 00:13:15.751
but their titles don't mean a thing.

00:13:17.251 --> 00:13:20.881
Hey, enough of that!
They risked their lives for us!

00:13:20.881 --> 00:13:24.381
Risked their lives? Anyone can do that.

00:13:24.381 --> 00:13:26.011
But a "hero" has to beat monsters.

00:13:26.631 --> 00:13:30.051
It all ended well this time, so whatever.

00:13:30.051 --> 00:13:36.021
But it's annoying when heroes who are really just
average Joes show up and try to save you.

00:13:36.521 --> 00:13:38.061
If you're gonna call yourself a hero, then—

00:13:38.061 --> 00:13:39.771
Shut your fat mouth!

00:13:40.311 --> 00:13:43.111
Why are you getting mad at me?

00:13:43.111 --> 00:13:46.451
The Hero Association gets their funds
from our donations, right?

00:13:46.451 --> 00:13:50.281
As long as we're paying for it,
they'd better protect us.

00:13:50.741 --> 00:13:54.911
The fact of the matter is that bald guy
pretty much took care of it all by himself.

00:13:55.621 --> 00:13:58.211
So all the other heroes died for nothing.

00:13:58.211 --> 00:14:01.671
Anyone can come up with
a way to buy a little time.

00:14:01.671 --> 00:14:05.961
In the end, the other "heroes" didn't do anything heroic.

00:14:05.961 --> 00:14:07.471
I said shut up!

00:14:07.471 --> 00:14:10.261
We were all saved. Just leave it at that.

00:14:10.261 --> 00:14:11.011
Exactly!

00:14:15.971 --> 00:14:17.641
Today's my lucky day!

00:14:18.271 --> 00:14:22.901
The other heroes wore the monster down,
so beating it was a piece of cake!

00:14:24.021 --> 00:14:25.821
Good thing I was late.

00:14:25.821 --> 00:14:29.281
I barely did a thing, and now I get all the credit.

00:14:29.281 --> 00:14:32.491
Hey, spread the word, all of you!

00:14:32.491 --> 00:14:35.491
I'm the one who finished the monster off!

00:14:35.491 --> 00:14:39.921
I'll beat the snot out of anyone who says
the hard work was already done for me!

00:14:39.921 --> 00:14:41.291
What's he mean?

00:14:41.291 --> 00:14:43.461
The monster was already weak?

00:14:43.461 --> 00:14:44.211
Huh?

00:14:44.211 --> 00:14:46.921
Hang on a sec. That's Saitama!

00:14:46.921 --> 00:14:48.131
Saitama?

00:14:48.131 --> 00:14:52.091
He's the hero from City Z that everyone calls a fraud.

00:14:52.091 --> 00:14:53.801
What? A fraud?

00:14:53.801 --> 00:14:57.561
He appeared out of nowhere
and climbed the ranks super fast.

00:14:57.561 --> 00:14:59.061
Yeah, pretty fishy.

00:14:59.061 --> 00:15:00.101
Hey, you guys!

00:15:00.691 --> 00:15:03.691
Look after the fallen heroes, okay?

00:15:03.691 --> 00:15:07.611
If they die on me, how am I
gonna cash in on their work?

00:15:07.611 --> 00:15:09.111
He is a fraud!

00:15:09.111 --> 00:15:10.451
Man, that's no fair.

00:15:10.451 --> 00:15:12.111
So he's just taking the credit?

00:15:12.411 --> 00:15:16.161
Compared to him, the other heroes
seem a little more heroic.

00:15:16.161 --> 00:15:19.501
If it weren't for all the other heroes…

00:15:19.501 --> 00:15:20.961
what would've happened?

00:15:21.331 --> 00:15:25.341
Yeah, I feel so grateful to them all.

00:15:28.961 --> 00:15:30.341
Master Saitama…

00:15:31.131 --> 00:15:33.051
Is this really what you want?

00:15:33.511 --> 00:15:35.391
Hey, it stopped raining.

00:15:36.011 --> 00:15:41.561
If this is the path you choose to walk,
I will not interfere.

00:15:42.351 --> 00:15:47.111
But in the future, if you are ever forced into a corner by this,

00:15:48.651 --> 00:15:50.491
at that moment, I will—

00:15:50.491 --> 00:15:52.451
Hey, there's one more.

00:15:55.621 --> 00:15:58.371
To the hero Saitama

00:15:55.621 --> 00:15:58.371
-Thanks to you, I--

00:15:55.621 --> 00:15:58.371
Thank

00:15:55.621 --> 00:15:58.371
you!!

00:15:59.501 --> 00:16:00.911
Someone's thanking me.

00:16:00.911 --> 00:16:03.961
It must be someone you saved.

00:16:04.541 --> 00:16:06.841
I see. Any left?

00:16:06.841 --> 00:16:09.631
There is one from the Hero Association.

00:16:09.961 --> 00:16:11.511
The Association?

00:16:11.511 --> 00:16:13.341
Are they firing me?

00:16:13.341 --> 00:16:14.511
Well, whatever.

00:16:14.551 --> 00:16:20.311
You are hereby recognized as rank

00:16:14.551 --> 00:16:20.311
of Class C.

00:16:14.551 --> 00:16:20.311
no. 1

00:16:14.551 --> 00:16:20.311
Sir Saitama

00:16:14.551 --> 00:16:20.311
(hero name: N/A)

00:16:14.551 --> 00:16:20.311
Hero Association

00:16:16.761 --> 00:16:17.641
What's this?

00:16:18.311 --> 00:16:20.311
I'm Class C… rank 1?

00:16:20.311 --> 00:16:22.681
CITY Z

00:16:20.311 --> 00:16:22.681
HERO ASSOCIATION OFFICE

00:16:22.231 --> 00:16:25.311
So, why'd you call me in?

00:16:25.941 --> 00:16:28.571
When you registered with the Hero Registry,

00:16:28.571 --> 00:16:30.941
you were given the Association handbook.

00:16:31.491 --> 00:16:36.991
Haven't you read it?
It lists all our rules and regulations.

00:16:36.991 --> 00:16:39.411
Yeah, I guess I've got it somewhere.

00:16:39.951 --> 00:16:44.081
No matter. Congratulations on
attaining rank 1 in Class C.

00:16:44.081 --> 00:16:46.081
Hm? Oh, I see.

00:16:46.081 --> 00:16:49.211
So you guys are the ones who decide the hero rankings.

00:16:49.211 --> 00:16:52.551
There are more members on the review board,

00:16:52.551 --> 00:16:55.971
but the four of us here today
will be handling your interview.

00:16:55.971 --> 00:16:56.721
Interview?

00:16:57.221 --> 00:17:03.141
The top ranking C-class hero is given
the option to be promoted to Class B.

00:17:03.141 --> 00:17:06.561
However, if you wish to remain in Class C, that's fine too.

00:17:06.561 --> 00:17:08.231
How about it, Mr. Saitama?

00:17:08.611 --> 00:17:10.401
Will you move up to Class B?

00:17:10.401 --> 00:17:13.361
If you do, you'll be at the
bottom of your class again.

00:17:13.361 --> 00:17:17.321
I'm fine either way,
but I guess I'll try moving up.

00:17:17.861 --> 00:17:20.371
That way, I won't have to deal with weekly quotas.

00:17:21.081 --> 00:17:26.121
Besides, with Genos in Class S,
I can't stick around in Class C forever.

00:17:26.501 --> 00:17:29.291
I see, so you want a promotion.

00:17:29.291 --> 00:17:33.511
First, we'll have you answer a few questions
and undergo a psychoanalysis.

00:17:35.091 --> 00:17:36.721
This Saitama…

00:17:36.721 --> 00:17:40.971
He's the one who finished off the Deep Sea King.

00:17:40.971 --> 00:17:42.221
What do you think?

00:17:42.221 --> 00:17:44.141
Some say he's a fraud.

00:17:44.471 --> 00:17:50.151
He broke every record in the fitness exam,
so his physical ability is solid.

00:17:50.151 --> 00:17:55.321
Well, according to rumors,
he cheated on the exams, too.

00:17:55.321 --> 00:17:57.031
Rumors are just rumors.

00:17:57.451 --> 00:18:00.871
No sense in doubting him now.

00:18:00.871 --> 00:18:03.371
The bottom line is, he wants to move up.

00:18:03.701 --> 00:18:06.751
Why not let him go for now?

00:18:06.751 --> 00:18:09.631
If he's for real, he'll make it in Class B.

00:18:10.501 --> 00:18:14.761
But if he's a fake, he'll soon regret it.

00:18:15.591 --> 00:18:18.761
He is entering a cruel and callous world.

00:18:19.181 --> 00:18:21.761
We'll cross that bridge when we get to it.

00:18:22.101 --> 00:18:24.141
Promotion to Class B?

00:18:25.471 --> 00:18:28.101
You interrupted my filming for this?

00:18:28.101 --> 00:18:30.521
This isn't worthy of my attention.

00:18:30.521 --> 00:18:33.151
This is a decision for the executive committee.

00:18:33.151 --> 00:18:34.401
Listen.

00:18:34.401 --> 00:18:38.701
I only want to be consulted about
heroes in Class A and above,

00:18:38.701 --> 00:18:41.031
since they have a strong impact on society.

00:18:41.031 --> 00:18:42.991
As a hero in the same class,

00:18:42.991 --> 00:18:46.331
if they're inadequate, it hurts my image too.

00:18:46.331 --> 00:18:48.161
Especially this last incident…

00:18:48.161 --> 00:18:51.041
Unknown Heroes Snatch

00:18:48.161 --> 00:18:51.041
yet Another Victory

00:18:48.161 --> 00:18:51.041
Unknown Heroes Snatch Victory

00:18:48.161 --> 00:18:51.041
From S - class Heroes

00:18:48.161 --> 00:18:51.041
DEFEAT!

00:18:48.911 --> 00:18:51.041
It was beyond inadequate. It was appalling.

00:18:51.791 --> 00:18:53.591
Don't you agree?

00:18:53.591 --> 00:18:55.631
Speaking of social impact,

00:18:55.631 --> 00:19:02.051
the hero now wanting to move up is the one
who finished off the Deep Sea King.

00:19:10.311 --> 00:19:12.311
Hero Association Hospital

00:19:15.821 --> 00:19:17.281
DEFEAT!

00:19:15.821 --> 00:19:18.821
Unknown Heroes

00:19:15.821 --> 00:19:18.821
yet Another Victory

00:19:16.021 --> 00:19:18.821
From S - class Heroes

00:19:16.531 --> 00:19:18.821
Snatch

00:19:22.951 --> 00:19:24.911
What's with the sour expressions?

00:19:26.121 --> 00:19:28.331
That's no way to show off those cute faces!

00:19:28.331 --> 00:19:29.411
You?!

00:19:29.411 --> 00:19:30.831
I thought you were back in prison!

00:19:32.501 --> 00:19:35.001
I escaped just to see you!

00:19:35.001 --> 00:19:38.381
Now, it's time for your Angel Shots!

00:19:38.381 --> 00:19:40.511
W-Wait for me!

00:19:40.511 --> 00:19:42.471
Wait! You need your meds!

00:19:46.971 --> 00:19:49.981
S-CLASS FAILURE!

00:19:46.971 --> 00:19:49.981
AN

00:19:55.731 --> 00:19:59.481
Approval
of Promotion

00:19:55.731 --> 00:19:59.481
Hero
Association

00:19:55.731 --> 00:19:59.481
Class B rank no. 101

00:19:55.731 --> 00:19:59.481
Saitama

00:19:55.731 --> 00:19:59.481
(hero name: N/A)

00:19:55.731 --> 00:19:59.481
We hereby certify that you have been promoted.

00:19:57.401 --> 00:19:59.481
So I'm in Class B now…

00:19:59.991 --> 00:20:02.531
Those tests took long enough.

00:20:02.531 --> 00:20:05.121
Meh, not like I had to be somewhere.

00:20:06.491 --> 00:20:07.831
Something smells good…

00:20:09.621 --> 00:20:10.501
Welcome.

00:20:13.001 --> 00:20:14.461
Assorted oden, please.

00:20:14.461 --> 00:20:15.751
All right.

00:20:15.751 --> 00:20:17.001
Want a drink?

00:20:18.671 --> 00:20:21.421
If you're not drinking, let me buy you a plate.

00:20:21.421 --> 00:20:22.591
Why?

00:20:22.591 --> 00:20:23.431
That.

00:20:24.721 --> 00:20:26.341
You were at the Association?

00:20:28.011 --> 00:20:30.391
Let's celebrate your promotion.

00:20:35.151 --> 00:20:37.651
Thanks for giving me a ride.

00:20:40.821 --> 00:20:42.191
Should I walk?

00:20:42.191 --> 00:20:44.911
N-No… I can handle it…

00:20:46.871 --> 00:20:49.371
Hey, are you scared?

00:20:50.161 --> 00:20:53.371
You got separated from the S-class hero Genos, right?

00:20:54.831 --> 00:20:57.001
The enemy is a Demon-level threat.

00:20:57.001 --> 00:20:59.841
A monster so formidable that even if all of Class C and Class B

00:20:59.841 --> 00:21:02.341
all ganged up on him, they'd never win.

00:21:02.341 --> 00:21:03.721
So if you want to run…

00:21:03.721 --> 00:21:05.511
Are you S-class too?

00:21:05.511 --> 00:21:08.431
N-No, I'm only C-class.

00:21:09.891 --> 00:21:11.771
Laugh if you want to.

00:21:12.141 --> 00:21:13.521
I'm not laughing.

00:21:15.101 --> 00:21:19.771
It sure is tough making those
weekly quotas for us C-classes…

00:21:22.281 --> 00:21:24.281
You're a funny guy.

00:21:25.861 --> 00:21:27.821
I'm Mumen Rider.

00:21:27.821 --> 00:21:29.781
I'm a hero, just like you.

00:21:32.161 --> 00:21:32.791
Huh?

00:21:32.791 --> 00:21:34.041
Hey! Watch it!

00:21:36.121 --> 00:21:38.791
Oh! You're that guy!

00:21:38.791 --> 00:21:40.791
I've been looking for you.

00:21:41.751 --> 00:21:43.841
I couldn't say everything in my letter.

00:21:47.881 --> 00:21:49.051
I see.

00:21:51.971 --> 00:21:53.431
Maybe some mozuku then?

00:21:53.431 --> 00:21:55.931
Hey! Give us your best mozuku!

00:21:55.931 --> 00:21:57.191
Comin' right up!

00:22:02.691 --> 00:22:08.951
Hey, come back home soon

00:22:02.691 --> 00:22:08.951
nee hayaku kaette kite ne

00:22:16.251 --> 00:22:22.171
When my worries keep me awake under the crescent moon

00:22:16.251 --> 00:22:22.171
tameiki ga mikazuki wo yurasu yoru wa

00:22:22.171 --> 00:22:28.301
All I can do is close my eyes and think of you

00:22:22.171 --> 00:22:28.301
me wo tojite kimi no koto kangaete bakari

00:22:28.301 --> 00:22:31.341
I want to see you, I feel like crying

00:22:28.301 --> 00:22:31.341
aitai kibun nakitai kibun

00:22:31.341 --> 00:22:33.851
I feel so romantic

00:22:31.341 --> 00:22:33.851
romantikku na kibun

00:22:33.851 --> 00:22:40.401
I hope my feelings reach you

00:22:33.851 --> 00:22:40.401
todokete kono omoi

00:22:40.851 --> 00:22:49.151
I know so very well

00:22:40.851 --> 00:22:49.151
datte zutto shitteiru no

00:22:49.151 --> 00:22:54.371
how hard you always work

00:22:49.151 --> 00:22:54.371
ganbatteru koto takusan

00:22:56.081 --> 00:22:59.041
You're the one I love

00:22:56.081 --> 00:22:59.041
daisuki na hito ga

00:22:59.041 --> 00:23:02.171
You're so strong, yet still I worry

00:22:59.041 --> 00:23:02.171
tsuyokute shinpai

00:23:02.171 --> 00:23:08.131
Only I ever see your weakness

00:23:02.171 --> 00:23:08.131
watashi ni dake wa yowasa misete

00:23:08.131 --> 00:23:14.181
I'll find you before the stars

00:23:08.131 --> 00:23:14.181
hoshi yori saki ni mitsukete ageru

00:23:14.181 --> 00:23:20.021
Come right back home

00:23:14.181 --> 00:23:20.021
massugu kaette kite ne

00:23:20.021 --> 00:23:28.231
Hey, come back home soon

00:23:20.021 --> 00:23:28.231
nee hayaku kaette kite ne

00:23:39.791 --> 00:23:41.331
I-It approaches!

00:23:41.331 --> 00:23:43.791
Madame Shibabawa? What's wrong?

00:23:43.791 --> 00:23:46.891
A violent catastrophe draws near…

00:23:46.891 --> 00:23:49.301
Madame Shibabawa! Get a hold of yourself!

00:23:49.921 --> 00:23:53.011
This is the end!

00:23:54.591 --> 00:23:58.011
E-Earth is doomed!

00:24:00.021 --> 00:24:20.041
NEXT
TIME

00:24:00.021 --> 00:24:20.041
UNPARALLELED
PERIL

00:24:00.811 --> 00:24:03.061
Hm? What is this place?

00:24:03.061 --> 00:24:04.901
I am the Deep Sea King!

00:24:04.901 --> 00:24:08.361
If I made one mistake,
it was not fighting the battle at sea.

00:24:08.361 --> 00:24:09.481
An away game!

00:24:09.481 --> 00:24:12.321
If we'd fought at sea,
it would have been an easy victory!

00:24:12.321 --> 00:24:14.781
Next time, on One Punch Man : Episode 10,

00:24:14.781 --> 00:24:16.531
"Unparalleled Peril."

00:24:16.531 --> 00:24:20.041
Really? There's something
even more dangerous than me?
